{section:faq title='Questions', open=1, single}
  {section:item 'Is PAD free?'}Yes - it is open source, under the GNU General Public License.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Does it need JavaScript?'}No. These sections are HTML and CSS; the questions open and close by themselves.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Does it need a database?'}
    <p>No. A page can read JSON, YAML, XML or CSV files.</p>
    <p>When it has one, MySQL and SQLite are both spoken.</p>
  {/section:item}
  {section:item 'Can I change the colours?'}Set the <code>--pad-section-*</code> properties, or choose a theme.{/section:item}
{/section:faq}
